---
apiVersion: kuttl.dev/v1beta1
kind: TestAssert
# Below-RF (2->1): the gate REFUSED the unsafe drain. The scaledown AgentRequest reported Failed (not a
# silent Done), the Scaler failed in PreScaling, and the STS stayed at 2 (never decremented). All
# resource stanzas → silent. gen6: create=1, 30=2, 50=3, 75=4, 77=5, 80=6. There is NO unregister-gen6
# — post_scale never runs when PreScaling fails.
timeout: 300
---
apiVersion: platform.stackable.tech/v1alpha1
kind: AgentRequest
metadata:
  name: test-kafka-broker-default-scaler-scaledown-gen6
status:
  phase: failed
---
apiVersion: autoscaling.stackable.tech/v1alpha1
kind: Scaler
metadata:
  name: test-kafka-broker-default-scaler
status:
  state:
    failed: {}
---
# The gate HELD: the broker STS was NOT decremented to 1 (stays 2). If the drain had silently succeeded
# (the bug this fixes), the STS would drop to 1 and this would never match.
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: StatefulSet
metadata:
  name: test-kafka-broker-default
status:
  readyReplicas: 2
  replicas: 2
